    "content": {
      "body": "\n<div class=\"kassia-ecosystem-grid\" style=\"background: #f8fafc; padding: 4rem 2rem; border-radius: 24px; margin-bottom: 4rem;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem;\">\n        <span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #dcfce7; color: #16a34a; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Portofoliu Complet</span>\n        <h2 style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">O Petrecere Fără Limite</h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #64748b; font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;\">Organizăm ecosistemul complet Kassia pentru petrecerea copilului tău. De la decor la spectacole live de excepție, găsești complet totul într-un singur loc.</p>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;\">\n        \n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/picioroange.png\" alt=\"Animatori pe Picioroange\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Animatori pe Picioroange</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Personaje pe catalige (picioroange), atracția supremă pentru spații deschise.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/magie.png\" alt=\"Spectacole de Magie\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Spectacole de Magie</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Trucuri captivante cu un magician profesionist care îi vor lăsa uimiți.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/gheata.png\" alt=\"Gheață Carbonică\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Gheață Carbonică</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Experimente educative și spectaculoase cu gheață carbonică.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/statui.png\" alt=\"Statui Vivante\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Statui Vivante</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Apariții memorabile și elegante, potrivite pentru evenimente profesionale.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/ursitoare.png\" alt=\"Ursitoare Botez & Moț\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Ursitoare Botez & Moț</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Spectacol emoționant cu ursitoare și text dedicat.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/vata.png\" alt=\"Vată de Zahăr\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Vată de Zahăr</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Atracția dulce nelipsită, preparată proaspăt pe loc.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/popcorn.png\" alt=\"Aparat de Popcorn\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Aparat de Popcorn</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Gustarea crocantă adorată de toți copiii.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/tort.png\" alt=\"Torturi din Dulciuri\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Torturi din Dulciuri</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Torturi masive construite din ciocolățele Kinder și Barni.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/gonflabile.png\" alt=\"Castele Gonflabile\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Castele Gonflabile</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Spații uriașe de sărit pentru energie maximă în siguranță.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/pinata.png\" alt=\"Joc Piñata\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Joc Piñata</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Momentul de bucurie explozivă și dulciuri în siguranță.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/treasure.png\" alt=\"Treasure Hunt\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Treasure Hunt</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Aventură captivantă și căutare de comori în aer liber.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/ateliere.png\" alt=\"Ateliere de Creație\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Ateliere de Creație</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Activități educative liniștite (slime, desen, pictură).</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/tematice.png\" alt=\"Petreceri Tematice\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Petreceri Tematice</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Scenariu de petrecere complet adaptat pasiunilor copiilor tăi.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/decor.png\" alt=\"Decoruri Baloane\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Decoruri Baloane</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Arcade organice, panouri foto și buchete profesionale.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/mese.png\" alt=\"Închiriere Mese & Scaune\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Închiriere Mese & Scaune</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Mobilier colorat (Kids Corner) la scară pentru cei mici.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/sapun.png\" alt=\"Baloane de Săpun\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Baloane de Săpun</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Momente magice cu baloane mari de săpun.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/mos.png\" alt=\"Moș Crăciun\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Moș Crăciun</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Distribuim magia pură a sărbătorilor cu Moș Crăciun și elfii săi.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/iepuras.png\" alt=\"Iepurașul de Paște\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Iepurașul de Paște</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Însoțit de sesiuni vesele de căutare a ouălor de ciocolată.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/halloween.png\" alt=\"Personaje Halloween\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Personaje Halloween</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Costume simpatice pentru cele mai cool petreceri de toamnă.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/cabina.png\" alt=\"Cabină Foto 360\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Cabină Foto 360</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Video-uri dinamice de senzație, gata de repostat pe social media.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; transition: transform 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n            <div style=\"width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; height: auto; background: #e2e8f0;\">\n                <img src=\"https://jrfhprnuxxfwkwjwdsez.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/storefront_media/kassia/ai/foto.png\" alt=\"Foto & Video\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; aspect-ratio: 1;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"padding: 1.5rem;\">\n                <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\">Foto & Video</h3>\n                <p style=\"color: #475569; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;\">Fotografii noștri nu ratează nicio secundă din emoția petrecerii.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>",
